mandatory.description:
Pick from your Maintenance Supporter tasks. Each pays once per day, and bonus chores unlock when all are done.

{items}

To show these chores in the dashboard's Maintenance Supporter list, give each task the label `mandatory` in Maintenance Supporter.

bonus.description:
Only paid out once all mandatory chores are done that day (held as pending until then). Bonus points are collected separately from the weekly goal and are only banked if the goal is met.

{items}

To show these chores in the dashboard's Maintenance Supporter list, give each task the label `bonus` in Maintenance Supporter.
